{
  "title": "Remove the deprecated database_version field from calorie estimates",
  "description": "CalorieEstimateResponse.database_version (server/src/api/recipes/estimate_calories.rs) is unused and always \"unused\". \
It is still sent because iOS builds generated before 2026-10-11 declare it as a required String, so a response without it fails to decode and the calorie section never shows. \
Current generated clients make it optional. \
Once older iOS builds are no longer in use, delete the field and regenerate the clients.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 4,
  "type": "task",
  "labels": [
    "api",
    "ios",
  ],
  "blocked": "iOS builds generated before 2026-10-11 must age out first; until then, dropping the field breaks their calorie estimates.",
  "created_at": "2026-10-11T15:44:00-07:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-10-11T15:44:00-07:00",
}
